      "text": "Generated test artifacts are written only to test-owned disposable output locations, not to repository fixture or documentation paths. The location is compared with the checkout by path segment under the path's own syntax: a Windows-form path (a drive letter or a backslash) ignores case, drive letter included, and a POSIX path compares ordinally; a case alias of the checkout or of a folder inside it is refused, and a distinct sibling is accepted (operator 2026-11-02: \"Strengthen 5 ACs, fix all 8 (Recommended)\"; hostile validation finding R9-F3).",
